[308.200294, "o", "The key insight: the model is dominated by dense mass-matrix factorizations and a Newton constraint solve. Using PGS with a tight tolerance converges to the same constraint solution while avoiding the expensive Newton warmstart/solve. Let me write the final model and validate.\r\n"]
